        <p>SHEPHERDS AT NVOOLSTON.</p>
        <p>The Loyal Order of Ancient Shepherds (WArrington District) held their first annual bowling main on Satur- day, at the Rope and Anchor,Woolston, when 64 players took part After some very keen competitions the 'final game with Josept! Appleton and Frederick Dale resulted in Appleton winning first prize by eleven chalks to nine. After the maidthe players sat down to tea provided by Mr. Daintith. Afterwards a pleasant hour was /pent in singing, and all returned home having I enjoyed the outing very much.</p>
